\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1039280/extras/4f46a4e34bfe7c5bbf4e02112171ab9c.webm?t=1726659794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1039280/extras/4f46a4e34bfe7c5bbf4e02112171ab9c.mp4?t=1726659794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Not all dogs bark the same way. Enjoy customizing <i>Bullet\u2019s</i> bark to your liking!<br><br><strong>ProtoCorgi core features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Retro style pixel art, horizontal shoot'em up with arcade gameplay and an award-winning Soundtrack.<br></li><li>ProtoCorgi Maker: Create, Share and play levels online.<br></li><li>Nine difficulty levels that alter level design rather than merely increasing numerical values.<br></li><li>Online leaderboards for Campaign and each ProtoCorgi Maker level.<br></li><li>Multiple Endings.<br></li><li>Over 27 weapons combinations and hidden secret abilities.<br></li><li>Mutators: These change the game's rules.<br></li><li>Caravan Mode: Adds a time limit to the game, compatible with Campaign, Training and ProtoCorgi Maker Levels.<br></li><li>Hyper Bark: Bark increases in power and size when hitting chest or fruits.<br></li><li>Pacifist Mode: A more challenging mode in which the user cannot use damaging abilities.<br></li><li>Training mode for practicing the different sections of the campaign.<br></li><li>Sound test mode.<br></li><li>Customize your Bark!. You can mod hats too, Check out our Discord for the how-to!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Get ready to Bark\u2019em Up! Play as Bullet, a C\u00b3 class (Cute Cybernetic Corgi) pup on his quest to save his owner, a brilliant scientist kidnapped by an alien race that wants to rule the galaxy. ProtoCorgi is a retro pixel art shoot\u2019em up with a strong arcade feel!",
